OL,3,GNEWSACathedrals finding creative ways
OL,4,Ato stay afloat
OL,5,
OL,6,FCathedral bosses say they have been
OL,7,Fforced to find creative ways to raise
OL,8,Fmoney as financial pressures mount.
OL,10,FBen Silvey, chief operating officer at
OL,11,FBristol Cathedral said they had began
OL,12,Fholding events including silent discos
OL,13,Fand street food markets to generate
OL,14,Fextra funds, as it posted a budget
OL,15,Fdeficit for the last two years.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, Nerys Watts, chief operating
OL,18,Fofficer at Wells Cathedral, which costs
OL,19,F#9,000 a day to stay open, said they
OL,20,Fintroduced charges for visitors outside
OL,21,Fof timetabled worship two years ago in
OL,22,Fa bid to preserve its income streams.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
